    "doc": "Trigger and readout devices at a fixed interval.\nNote that the interval time cannot be less than the exposure time.\nThe effective sleep time between points is:\n    sleep_time = max(interval - exp_time, 0)\n\nArgs:\n    points (int): points.\n    interval (float [s]): interval. s\n    exp_time (float [s]): Exposure time in seconds. Default: 0 s\n    settling_time (float [s]): Time to settle before trigger and readout. Default: 0 s\n\nReturns:\n    ScanReport\n\nExamples:\n    Minimum:\n        >>> scans.time_scan(1, 1.0)\n    Full:\n        >>> scans.time_scan(1, 1.0, exp_time=0, settling_time=0)",
    "gui_visibility": {
      "Scan Parameters": [
        "points",
        "interval",
        "exp_time",
        "settling_time"
      ]
    }
